\pard{\pntext\f10\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f3\fs28  Results and Findings\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b0\f2\fs22\par

\pard\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\qj\f9\fs24 * Mumbai Indians recorded the highest number of wins.\par
* Fielding was the preferred toss decision for most teams.\par
* Certain venues hosted significantly more matches than others.\par
* Several players consistently won Player of the Match awards.\par
* IPL data reveals interesting patterns that can be explored through data analytics.\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\f2\fs22\par

\pard{\pntext\f10\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf10\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa200\sl276\slmult1\b\f3\fs28 Conclusion\b0\f2\fs22\par

\pard\sa200\sl276\slmult1\fs24 This project successfully applied data analysis and visualization techniques to IPL match data from 2008\endash 2020. The use of Pandas, Matplotlib, and Seaborn enabled the extraction of meaningful insights regarding team performance, player achievements, and match trends. Sports analytics can help teams, analysts, and fans better understand performance patterns and make data-driven decisions.\par
\fs22\par

